<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Telkom H1 profit rises.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Telkom H1 profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			  (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     701.8  vs 484.3</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (in rupiah)    75.20 vs  57.65</p>
<p>    Operating revenues		 2,375.69 vs 2,357.36</p>
<p>    Operating expenses		 1,429.96 vs 1,583.01</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 954.12 vs 708.13</p>
<p>    Retained earnings		  1,559.41 vs 2,634.60</p>
<p>Note: PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) is Indonesia's state-owned telecommunications firm which is also listed in New York.</p>
</text>
